 ],
 "synopsis": "Zetwerk Manufacturing is planning an initial public offering to raise up to ₹2,830 crore through fresh equity, alongside an offer for sale aiming to raise up to ₹2,182 crore. The promoter group's stake will reduce from 20.7% to 15.4% following the IPO. Incorporated in 2017 and backed by investors including Peak XV Partners, Accel India, and Lightspeed India Partners, the manufacturer operates a universal factory model across multiple countries. Financial disclosures note that while revenue from operations increased, the company continues to make net losses with thin operating margins, rising debt, and negative operating cash flow trends.",
